{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Dark Fountains\n🌊 They shape every Dark World. Any \"determined\" Lightner can open one — too many at once triggers the Roaring.","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Dark_Fountain_screenshot.webp","x":-75,"y":-425,"width":200,"height":150},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Roaring Knight**\nMain suspect: opens the Library (Ch.2), three Fountains in Ch.4, and one of the twin Fountains in Ch.5.","x":-150,"y":-930,"width":300,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/TheRoaringKnightDeltarune.webp","x":-95,"y":-1315,"width":149,"height":170},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Kris**\nPersonally opens the one in Toriel's living room (Ch.3) and the main one at Flower King (Ch.5), always at night and without his SOUL.","x":332,"y":-773,"width":300,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Dark_Fountain_screenshot_TV_World_creation.png","x":628,"y":-1080,"width":190,"height":143},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Susie**\nOpens her own first Fountain at the 2nd Sanctuary (Ch.4), inspired by Queen's words.","x":630,"y":-363,"width":300,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Susie_overworld_eyes.png","x":1075,"y":-465,"width":97,"height":170},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Titan**\nBorn when a Fountain opens with much more intensity than normal — the one at the 3rd Sanctuary, so far the only confirmed case.","x":630,"y":143,"width":300,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/dark_fountain_3_sanctuary_titan_creation.png","x":1075,"y":295,"width":190,"height":143},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Ralsei and Queen**\nRalsei is the only one who senses their presence before finding them. Queen explains in Ch.2 the exact mechanics of how they open.","x":332,"y":553,"width":300,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"**Noelle and Berdly**\nNoelle refuses to open one despite Queen's coercion. Berdly is about to open one inside the Cyber World as an apology to her.","x":-150,"y":710,"width":300,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"s6","type":"text","text":"**🎲 The Shelter Fountain**\nThe only one, along with the Ch.1 one, whose opener is a complete unknown — it has never been fully sealed or explored.","x":-632,"y":553,"width":300,"height":220,"color":"1"},{"id":"s6-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Dark_Fountain_screenshot_shelter.png","x":-818,"y":910,"width":190,"height":143},{"id":"s7","type":"text","text":"**🎲 Who opened the Ch.1 one?**\nNeither the game nor the wiki confirms it. The main suspects are Kris and the Roaring Knight.","x":-930,"y":143,"width":300,"height":220,"color":"1"},{"id":"s7-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/DEVICE_MENU_screenshot_Dark_Fountain.gif","x":-1265,"y":295,"width":190,"height":143},{"id":"s8","type":"text","text":"**🎲 The twin Fountains of Ch.5**\nThe Fountain the Knight opens to capture Asgore is identical to the one Kris just opened — the most cited visual proof of the \"Kris is the Knight\" theory.","x":-930,"y":-363,"width":300,"height":220,"color":"1"},{"id":"s8-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Dark_Fountain_screenshot_Flower_Kingdom.png","x":-1265,"y":-465,"width":190,"height":143},{"id":"s9","type":"text","text":"**The Roaring, in the Prophecy**\nStained-glass window 04 of the Last Prophecy literally mentions the Roaring and the Titans even before Ralsei explains it in Ch.2.","x":-632,"y":-773,"width":300,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"s9-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/The_Roaring_screenshot_Dark_Fountains.png","x":-818,"y":-1080,"width":190,"height":138}],"edges":[{"id":"e_center-img","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"center","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s0","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s1","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s2","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s2-img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s3","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s3-img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s5","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s6","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s6","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s6-img","fromNode":"s6-img","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s6","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s7","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s7","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s7-img","fromNode":"s7-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s7","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s8","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s8","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s8-img","fromNode":"s8-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s8","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s9","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s9","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s9-img","fromNode":"s9-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s9","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_knight_twins","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s8","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_kris_twins","fromNode":"s1","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s8","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_knight_titan","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s3","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_shelter_cap1_mystery","fromNode":"s6","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s7","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_ralsei_prophecy","fromNode":"s4","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s9","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_susie_queen","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s4","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_noelle_queen","fromNode":"s5","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s4","toSide":"right","color":"1"}]}